      "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@sabrinastrong11/video/7692598273437175054",
      "caption": "The best way to lose fat is to walk more… 👀 But there comes a point where less is MORE…  If you’re walking under 8-12k steps a day then you are missing out on the EASIEST way to help you lose body fat.  If you’re walking over 15k then you could be doing yourself a disservice. Recovery starts to take a hit & your hunger increases - taking you out of the deficit you were trying to be in.   Finding a sweet spot that works for your lifestyle and goals is key.  10k steps is what I prioritize and recommend. Follow for more tips to lean out 🤝 #gymgirl #gymlife #fitness #gymhumor #fitnesstips ",
